395
00:27:04,493 --> 00:27:06,333
- Thank you.
- Ms. Kusakabe, Ms. Kusakabe!

396
00:27:06,333 --> 00:27:07,845
Excuse me, we're out of the flyers.

397
00:27:07,845 --> 00:27:09,875
- Oh, I'll go get some more.
- Thank you.

398
00:27:16,541 --> 00:27:18,328
Ms. Mondo?

399
00:27:19,481 --> 00:27:22,315
Oh, my.

400
00:27:25,173 --> 00:27:29,201
