Your ranking seems to be climbing steadily.

401
00:27:29,201 --> 00:27:31,553
Yes, somehow.

402
00:27:31,553 --> 00:27:36,293
And Berry is currently 25th, right?
That's amazing.

403
00:27:37,237 --> 00:27:41,801
Well, but if she doesn't get into the top 20,

404
00:27:41,801 --> 00:27:44,705
I'll be retiring.

405
00:27:44,705 --> 00:27:46,477
What?

406
00:27:47,085 --> 00:27:48,885
Why?

407
00:27:49,617 --> 00:27:50,845
Why would you do that?

408
00:27:50,845 --> 00:27:54,205
