409
00:27:54,205 --> 00:27:56,700
Only if we fail.

410
00:27:59,325 --> 00:28:02,077
Does Mr. Seo know about this?

411
00:28:03,741 --> 00:28:06,741
I should get back.

412
00:28:07,633 --> 00:28:11,373
Let's do our best.

413
00:28:48,901 --> 00:28:54,369
[All-Japan Character Grand Prix,
