424
00:29:19,673 --> 00:29:21,213
Ms. Kusakabe.

425
00:29:21,213 --> 00:29:23,345
Let's do our best today.

426
00:29:25,021 --> 00:29:28,549
The fates of everyone in
the character business will be decided today.

427
00:29:28,549 --> 00:29:30,433
