446
00:31:05,261 --> 00:31:07,417
[25th Place: 11,038 votes, Nyanko Neko]
24th place:

447
00:31:07,417 --> 00:31:09,805
Daikon Pyon.

448
00:31:09,805 --> 00:31:12,821
A lovable character
with a daikon radish motif.

449
00:31:12,821 --> 00:31:15,601
Its energetic nature appeals to a wide...

450
00:31:16,485 --> 00:31:22,181
<i>If she doesn't get into the top 20,
I'll be retiring.</i>

451
00:31:25,229 --> 00:31:27,665
23rd place:

452
00:31:28,377 --> 00:31:30,593
Lemocapy.

453
00:31:30,593 --> 00:31:33,493
22nd place:

454
00:31:33,493 --> 00:31:35,525
Tako Piyomaru.

455
00:31:36,177 --> 00:31:38,857
21st place:

456
00:31:43,585 --> 00:31:45,957
[21st Place: 18,742 votes]
Very Good Berry.

457
00:31:46,821 --> 00:31:50,033
A signature character of Merry Co., Ltd.

458
00:31:50,033 --> 00:31:51,908
Known for the catchphrase "Berry good,"

459
00:31:51,908 --> 00:31:55,777
