460
00:31:55,777 --> 00:32:00,449
20th place: Labravo.

461
00:32:00,449 --> 00:32:02,973
Labravo's motif is a Labrador Retriever.

462
00:32:02,973 --> 00:32:08,525
With its energetic signature phrase,
