463
00:32:08,525 --> 00:32:11,909
And now, 19th place:

464
00:32:11,909 --> 00:32:14,932
[19th Place: 25,638 votes]
first-time entry Tutu-Tuesla.

465
00:32:16,593 --> 00:32:18,345
Yes!

466
00:32:24,197 --> 00:32:28,461
Tutu-Tuesla, created with
