475
00:32:52,313 --> 00:32:53,949
The police?

476
00:32:53,949 --> 00:32:57,569
Do you know a man named Mizuki Seo?

477
00:33:09,873 --> 00:33:11,597
Thank you.

478
00:33:12,825 --> 00:33:15,993
[Setagaya West Police Station]

479
00:33:18,301 --> 00:33:20,062
I'm sorry.

480
00:33:21,873 --> 00:33:24,561
- O-Con!
- Why were you reported to the police?

481
00:33:24,561 --> 00:33:26,377
No, it's not what you think.

482
00:33:26,377 --> 00:33:29,289
I was thinking that
maybe I should head back soon,

483
00:33:29,289 --> 00:33:31,620
