496
00:34:16,753 --> 00:34:19,585
[10th Place: 101,476 votes]
The signature character of Merry Co., Ltd.,

497
00:34:19,585 --> 00:34:21,669
whose catchphrase is
"That kind of thing. Hmph."

498
00:34:21,669 --> 00:34:24,329
This year, it also became a hot topic
thanks to its movie adaptation.

499
00:34:24,329 --> 00:34:28,261
Cynical Molco dropped significantly
from last year's 1st place,

500
00:34:28,261 --> 00:34:30,728
but it still made the top 10.

501
00:34:31,821 --> 00:34:33,677
What are you doing?

502
00:34:34,445 --> 00:34:36,945
You know what day it is today, right?

503
00:34:36,945 --> 00:34:39,510
Well... yeah.

504
00:34:41,005 --> 00:34:43,723
Oh, right. What place did Tuesla get?

505
00:34:44,985 --> 00:34:47,261
19th.

506
00:34:47,261 --> 00:34:49,609
What? That's amazing!

507
00:34:49,609 --> 00:34:53,268
Well... I mean, it's annoying
that it's not first, but...

508
00:34:55,957 --> 00:34:59,402
- Mr. Seo, well...
- What about Berry?

509
00:35:03,733 --> 00:35:05,641
21st.

510
00:35:06,557 --> 00:35:08,053
What?

511
00:35:08,053 --> 00:35:09,193
Next,

512
00:35:09,193 --> 00:35:10,733
[New Designer Award]
in honor of those who have been active

513
00:35:10,733 --> 00:35:12,961
[Tokyo Design Floor: Moeka Watanabe]
in the character industry for many years,

514
00:35:12,961 --> 00:35:14,529
we will now be announcing the Honorary Award.

515
00:35:14,529 --> 00:35:17,589
[Honorary Award]

516
00:35:17,589 --> 00:35:19,689
The Honorary Award goes to...

517
00:35:19,689 --> 00:35:21,673
Ms. Mariko Mondo.

518
00:35:26,449 --> 00:35:30,705
I... beat her. I beat Berry's ranking.

519
00:35:34,133 --> 00:35:37,113
Come on, Mr. Seo, let's go to the venue.

520
00:35:37,113 --> 00:35:38,893
Why bother? The announcement is over, right?

521
00:35:38,893 --> 00:35:41,497
Ms. Mondo said that she's retiring.

522
00:35:43,249 --> 00:35:45,938
She said that if Berry didn't
get into the top 20, she'd retire.

523
00:35:46,901 --> 00:35:48,757
That's what she said.

524
00:35:49,597 --> 00:35:51,617
Wait a second, that doesn't make any sense.

525
00:35:53,993 --> 00:35:55,805
Let's go.

526
00:36:11,437 --> 00:36:17,173
[Honorary Award: Mariko Mondo,
Merry Co., Ltd.]

527
00:36:21,873 --> 00:36:24,641
<i>I've been living as a designer</i>

528
00:36:24,641 --> 00:36:29,001
for nearly half a century now.

529
00:36:30,025 --> 00:36:34,369
I was able to create the character Berry.

530
00:36:34,369 --> 00:36:39,385
I'm grateful that
so many people have loved her.

531
00:36:40,245 --> 00:36:45,205
Every designer has a prime.

532
00:36:45,205 --> 00:36:50,685
And I passed my prime long ago.

533
00:36:51,713 --> 00:36:56,993
<i>The times keep changing faster and faster,</i>

534
00:36:56,993 --> 00:37:01,133
<i>and trends come and go so rapidly.</i>

535
00:37:01,133 --> 00:37:02,737
I worry that

536
00:37:02,737 --> 00:37:08,621
someday, people will forget about Berry too.

537
00:37:08,621 --> 00:37:12,473
There are times when I think that.

538
00:37:13,465 --> 00:37:19,193
This time, Berry placed 21st.

539
00:37:19,193 --> 00:37:24,697
But no matter what her rank, to me...

540
00:37:24,697 --> 00:37:27,445
I really like Berry.

541
00:37:28,753 --> 00:37:30,933
What are you drawing?

542
00:37:31,637 --> 00:37:35,035
You're so good! Amazing!

543
00:37:35,677 --> 00:37:37,677
Good!

544
00:37:38,969 --> 00:37:41,207
To me...

545
00:37:47,445 --> 00:37:52,400
there are people who love Berry.

546
00:37:53,897 --> 00:37:57,405
People who keep Berry close to them,

547
00:37:57,405 --> 00:38:00,795
and who have kept loving her all this time.

548
00:38:01,965 --> 00:38:06,921
That's why I've been able to
continue this work until today.

549
00:38:06,921 --> 00:38:13,233
And today, I will end that work.

550
00:38:14,837 --> 00:38:19,401
I'm leaving Merry.

551
00:38:23,797 --> 00:38:26,918
As for Berry,

552
00:38:26,918 --> 00:38:33,477
I believe Merry
will continue to protect Berry.

553
00:38:34,305 --> 00:38:39,541
Many more characters
will be born in the future.

554
00:38:39,541 --> 00:38:44,185
There will be many more Grand Prix events,
and rankings will be given.

555
00:38:44,185 --> 00:38:48,045
Popularity contests will be held.

556
00:38:48,045 --> 00:38:54,149
But characters don't exist
for the sake of competition.

557
00:38:54,149 --> 00:38:56,453
They exist so that we can all come together.

558
00:38:56,453 --> 00:39:01,860
And they bring smiles to everyone's faces.

559
00:39:03,709 --> 00:39:09,258
Please, don't ever forget that.

560
00:39:24,569 --> 00:39:27,112
[All-Japan Character Grand Prix 2026]

561
00:39:27,112 --> 00:39:29,033
Yes, strike a happy pose.

562
00:39:47,801 --> 00:39:49,805
Hey.

563
00:39:59,549 --> 00:40:03,040
It's frustrating, isn't it?

564
00:40:03,797 --> 00:40:08,489
Berry was so close.

565
00:40:08,489 --> 00:40:11,097
But I have no regrets.

566
00:40:12,025 --> 00:40:13,985
I gave it my all.

567
00:40:14,825 --> 00:40:16,889
If Tuesla hadn't entered,

568
00:40:17,501 --> 00:40:19,753
Berry would have made the top 20.

569
00:40:21,421 --> 00:40:23,781
If Tuesla hadn't beaten her...

570
00:40:23,781 --> 00:40:25,733
Don't be ridiculous.

571
00:40:27,393 --> 00:40:30,027
That's just arrogance.

572
00:40:35,377 --> 00:40:39,573
Creating a character is a difficult thing.

573
00:40:39,573 --> 00:40:42,873
But what's truly difficult

574
00:40:42,873 --> 00:40:47,265
is leaving a lasting impression
in people's hearts for a long, long time.

575
00:40:48,069 --> 00:40:50,541
To be loved continuously.

576
00:40:51,333 --> 00:40:56,398
Do you understand how hard that is?

577
00:40:57,317 --> 00:41:02,525
Tuesla hasn't achieved anything yet.

578
00:41:03,129 --> 00:41:06,973
It has only just reached
the entrance to this world.

579
00:41:06,973 --> 00:41:13,305
At the entrance to a thorny path
that will continue for decades.

580
00:41:14,013 --> 00:41:18,761
People who will get in your way,
people who will try to use you,

581
00:41:18,761 --> 00:41:22,337
and people who will slander and attack you.

582
00:41:22,337 --> 00:41:25,161
Around cuteness,

583
00:41:25,161 --> 00:41:29,290
all sorts of ugly monsters are lurking.

584
00:41:31,221 --> 00:41:34,181
All those monsters and thorny paths

585
00:41:34,181 --> 00:41:39,309
were overcome because
I had the feeling of love.

586
00:41:39,309 --> 00:41:43,780
Love made me strong.

587
00:41:44,925 --> 00:41:49,413
Love is strong, but also fleeting.

588
00:41:50,293 --> 00:41:54,935
That's precisely why,
if you're going to live in this world,

589
00:41:56,297 --> 00:41:58,929
you must be prepared.

590
00:41:58,929 --> 00:42:04,881
No matter what happens around you,
stick to what you love.

591
00:42:05,965 --> 00:42:10,541
Hold onto what's important,

592
00:42:10,541 --> 00:42:14,393
and protect it with your own hands.

593
00:42:15,097 --> 00:42:20,141
I'm looking forward to seeing

594
00:42:20,141 --> 00:42:22,727
how far you two can go.

595
00:42:26,733 --> 00:42:28,515
See you.

596
00:42:35,945 --> 00:42:37,773
Grandma.

597
00:42:47,501 --> 00:42:49,805
Thank you for creating Berry,

598
00:42:54,105 --> 00:42:55,889
for creating...

599
00:42:59,141 --> 00:43:01,405
for creating what I love.

600
00:43:06,133 --> 00:43:07,917
Thank you.

601
00:43:49,837 --> 00:43:51,545
Mr. Seo.

602
00:44:11,477 --> 00:44:14,029
Oh, well...

603
00:44:14,029 --> 00:44:17,833
I'm not Berry, you know.

604
00:44:33,193 --> 00:44:34,945
O-Con.

605
00:44:36,153 --> 00:44:38,489
Yes? Yes?

606
00:44:38,489 --> 00:44:40,257
Let's get married.

607
00:44:41,233 --> 00:44:42,973
Yes.

608
00:44:44,825 --> 00:44:46,557
What?
